desc:jsfx-bench --diff: 段 S3 の読み直し・書いた値の流用が、?:・min・max・ユーザーの積み場・spl() 越しの書き込みをまたがないか
slider1:0.5<-1,1,0.01>A
in_pin:L
in_pin:R
out_pin:L
out_pin:R
@init
buf = 100;
@sample
a = spl0; b = spl1;
t1 = a * b + 1;
(spl0 > 0 ? a : b) += 3;
t2 = a * b + 1;
min(a, b) = t2 * 0.5;
t3 = a * b + 1;
max(a, b) *= 2;
t4 = a * b + 1;
stack_push(a); stack_exch(b); stack_pop(a);
t5 = a * b + 1;
(slider1 > 0 ? a : buf[3]) = 9;
t6 = a * b + 1;
spl(0) = t1 + a;
t7 = spl0 * 2 + t1;
(t7 > 1 ? spl0 : spl1) -= 0.25;
t8 = spl0 * 2 + spl1;
c = a; a = 0.5; d = c + b; a = d * c; e = a + c;
spl0 = t1 + t2*2 + t3*3 + t4*4 + t5*5 + t6*6 + t7*7 + t8*8 + e;
spl1 = a - b + d;
